Exceptions and third-party material

1. Institutional policy excerpts. Short excerpts from published rules of
   Philippine institutions appear in the cases, answer keys, prompts and
   extension evidence excerpts. They are quoted for research and review. They
   remain under their owners' terms and are NOT licensed under CC BY 4.0 by this
   repository. Full institutional documents are not redistributed; see
   literature/institutional-sources.csv for links.

2. AI model outputs. Raw and parsed model replies (extensions/, and answers
   embedded in judge prompts) were generated by third-party AI services. They are
   provided as research records; the service providers' terms may also apply.

3. Cited literature. literature/source-register.csv lists bibliographic
   metadata only. No full texts are included.

